# D3-AD-002: An adsorbent can saturate before the water becomes colourless
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
add v1 water 50mL
add v1 activated_charcoal 0.10g
add v1 methyl_orange 0.005g
measure v1 uvvis
add v1 methyl_orange 0.03g
measure v1 uvvis
look v1
add v1 activated_charcoal 0.30g
measure v1 uvvis
look v1
inspect
